{"change_summary":"Updated the nitrogen-cycle accounting surface so alkalinity attribution uses the correct TAN-oxidation basis instead of the nitrate-production shortcut, added symmetric alkalinity consumed/produced diagnostics for future denitrification wiring, threaded those diagnostics into budget entries and trace notes, and strengthened the nitrification regression tests to assert the new trace/budget visibility and NOB-only behavior.","outstanding_risks":["`alkalinity_produced_meq` is still a zero-valued placeholder until denitrification lands; the interface is prepared, but the return path is not implemented yet.","A broader `cargo test -p tank_core --tests` sweep still fails in `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` (`crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs:368`); that save/load determinism issue remains unresolved in this stage."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspect the existing nitrogen-cycle output, trace notes, and alkalinity regression coverage to map the review gaps.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Refactor `NitrogenCycleOutput` and engine diagnostics to expose TAN oxidation, nitrate production, and symmetric alkalinity attribution, and add budget metrics for alkalinity visibility.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Extend the nitrification regression tests to lock the new trace-level and budget-level alkalinity assertions and rerun the targeted validation suites.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo fmt --all`","`cargo test -p tank_core --test nitrification_alkalinity` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test tracing` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_tracking` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test budget_helpers` passed earlier during validation after the budget entry schema change.","`cargo test -p tank_core --tests` was run and exposed one pre-existing broader failure: `save_load_with_active_cycle_state` in `crates/tank_core/tests/save_load.rs:368`."]}